<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alpharma said cut by OpCo.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alpharma said cut by OpCo.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co on Monday cut its rating of Alpharma Inc to a market perform from its previous rating of buy, according to an Oppenheimer source.</p>
<p>-- Alpharma shares closed at 14-7/8 on Friday.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst Steve Gerber was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
